  "observed_control_path": [
    "CPU decodes and validates each immutable run and writes each triangle job over MMIO.",
    "CPU starts preflight and synchronously polls completion; current raw vertices and shared FMA remain reserved.",
    "CPU reads keep/fallback masks, resolves supported materials, compacts surviving jobs and computes dirty vertex slots.",
